ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

Acute on chronic CHF.

Medical Reasoning: This was caused by dietary indiscretion in an uncontrolled hypertension.

Patient Education and Counseling: The patient was advised to continue on bumex 2 mg once a day. He was advised to continue to watch his diet and avoid salty foods. He was advised to weigh himself daily and to call if he gains 3 pounds in 2 days. He was advised to see a nutritionist for dietary counseling.

