Brittany Edwards is a pleasant 32-year-old female who was last seen in August 2019 with flares of abdominal pain. She was diagnosed with irritable bowel syndrome and treated with Bentyl.

Irritable bowel syndrome, aggravated by high stress, poor eating habits, and poor sleeping habits.
