The patient reports that he is not experiencing any fevers. He denies vomiting. He is able to tolerate food but notes that he has pain after eating. He rates his pain as 8/10. The pain is located on the right side of his abdomen, under his ribcage, and is described as a squeezing pain. He notes that he is nauseated when he has pain.

