PHYSICAL EXAM

Respiratory
- Auscultation of Lungs: Clear bilaterally.

Cardiovascular
- Auscultation of Heart: Regular rate and rhythm. No murmurs, gallops, or rubs.

Gastrointestinal
- Examination: Normal bowel sounds.

Musculoskeletal
- Examination: Midline tenderness at the L4-L5 disk space. Right sided lumbar paravertebral tenderness. Pain with lumbar flexion. Supine straight leg test is positive.

NEUROLOGIC
- Examination: Patella and Achilles reflexes are symmetrical. No decreased sensation.

RESULTS

