Cardiovascular: Reports history of hypertension.
Endocrine: Reports history of diabetes.
Musculoskeletal: Reports knee pain.

VITALS

Oxygen Saturation: 94% on room air.

PHYSICAL EXAM

Respiratory
- Auscultation of Lungs: Diminished breath sounds bilaterally, R > L. Rales and rhonchi noted on the right side.

Cardiovascular
- Auscultation of Heart: 2/6 ejection murmur. Regular rate and rhythm otherwise.

Musculoskeletal
- Examination of Musculoskeletal: 1+ nonpitting edema in both lower extremities. No calf tenderness. No homans sign.

RESULTS

