Mr. Jones denies shortness of breath or problems sleeping. He states that he can get up and move around and does not have any trouble. He reports that he has a good afternoon nap. He denies chest pain.

The patient reports that he has been checking his blood pressure at home and it has been really good. He reports that he has been doing well since he has been home. He states that he has been watching his diet and taking his medications. He states that he has been doing well and does not want to go back to the hospital.

