RESULTS

Echocardiogram shows a preserved EF of 55%, abnormal diastolic filling, and mild to moderate mitral regurgitation.

ASSESSMENT AND PLAN

Mr. Kevin Jones is an 82-year-old male with a past medical history significant for hypertension and stage 3 chronic kidney disease who presents for follow-up after an acute on chronic CHF exacerbation.

• Congestive heart failure.
