The patient is an Olympic weightlifter and works out several times per week. He reports that his pain has affected his exercise routine, and he is no longer as active as he was previously. He notes that his father has a history of back pain.

MEDICAL HISTORY

Patient reports a history of playing soccer.

SOCIAL HISTORY

