Psychiatric: Denies depression, anxiety.

VITALS

Blood pressure: 160/95 mmHg

PHYSICAL EXAM

Neck: Supple without lymphadenopathy.
Heart: Irregular rate and rhythm. Slight 2/6 systolic ejection murmur.
